# Khronos header checkouts the Vulkan backend builds against (~56 MB of upstream
# headers, plus SPIRV-Headers' local `cmake --install` tree). Kept in the project
# root so the build finds them without a sibling directory, but not committed.
# See the Build from Source section of the README for the two clone commands.
# Delete these two lines if you would rather vendor them into the repo.
/Vulkan-Headers/
/SPIRV-Headers/

.android/
